# Embedded Magic on examples/sky130-inv (docs/MAGIC.md): the picture, Magic's own
# commands and key macros, saving (use paths, sidecar), DRC results with box and zoom,
# Generate from Schematic, cross-probing with the schematic tab. Needs Magic, sky130A
# and the helpers built (cargo build -p cdept-magic -p cdept-xschem):
#
#   PDK_ROOT=/opt/ext/OpenPDKs CDEPT_MAGIC=/opt/ext/OpenLane/bin/magic \
#   CDEPT_XSCHEM=target/debug/cdept-xschem CDEPT_EXAMPLE=sky130-inv \
#       cdept-gui/scripts/run.sh cdept-gui/scripts/magic.script
#
# Screenshots go to /tmp/cdept-magic-*.png.

open cells inv layout
wait_frame
tcl_expect sky130A tech name
magic expect_cell inv
magic expect_missing 0
check_picture
screenshot /tmp/cdept-magic-open.png

# Magic's commands from CDePT's command line, and its answers in the messages.
magic command box 0 -3um 0.1um -1um
magic command paint m1
magic expect_modified 1
magic expect_log % paint m1

# DRC as the cell is now: a 0.1 um wide metal1 strip is too narrow.
magic drc
magic expect_drc >0
magic drc_show 0
wait_frame
screenshot /tmp/cdept-magic-drc.png

# Undo with CDePT's Edit action (Magic's `undo`): the metal1 strip is gone (Magic
# keeps the cell marked as changed). Then a change and a save.
key z ctrl
tcl_expect 0 llength [lindex [what -list] 0]
magic command paint m2
magic expect_modified 1
magic save
magic expect_saved
tcl_expect 0 llength [cdept::magic::modified]

# A key macro typed over the drawing: `v` is Magic's "view" (zoom to fit).
move 200 150
key v
wait_frame
check_picture

# Generate from Schematic: the layout has the schematic's devices already.
magic generate
magic expect_generated
magic expect_log in sync

# Cross-probing: an instance selected in Magic is selected in the schematic, and back.
open cells inv schematic
wait_frame
open cells inv layout
tcl_send select clear; select cell M1
magic expect_selected M1
open cells inv schematic
expect_selected M1
tcl_send xschem unselect_all; xschem select instance M2
wait 1
open cells inv layout
magic expect_selected M2
screenshot /tmp/cdept-magic-probe.png

quit
